 Philadelphia is riding in Lancaster County this weekend. They have invited
  us to join them on this ride.\n\nThis is a FUN RIDE ride. The ride leader
  will ride at the advertised average speed. This is intended to be a group
  ride with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/he
 r best to keep the group together with occasional regroupings and/or split
 ting into multiple groups to align to pace capabilities.\n\nPlease do not 
 join this ride if you are not willing to ride with the group.\n\nHelmets a
 re mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare
  tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a
  pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP bel
 ow to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club member.
