 club's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.ne
 t/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if 
 an incident occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/conte
 nt.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
